      "text": "The proposed public engine boundary covers complete account read/write, supported-format and revision checks, coordinated single-writer semantics, atomic old-or-complete-new recovery, preservation of previous/corrupt/future state, and typed failures including uncertain outcomes. API/type names and backend remain unselected. | Involving: Madar; Dakhl | The boundary is described as validated in scope, but it is not approved for implementation.",
